2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     longer be ejected on price action that happened before it was opened.
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]   + FIX C (SMA8 arm window): trail arms on bars-SINCE-ENTRY, not bars-of-day.
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     sma8_low_of_option() now averages only TODAY's closed bars that closed AFTER
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     entry and needs >= SMA_TRAIL_MIN_BARS_SINCE_ENTRY (1) of them. With 1 own bar
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     SMA8L == that bar's own low, so close(>=low) can't trigger -> first real
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     trigger needs >=2 own bars. SMA_TRAIL_MIN_BARS (4, bars-of-day) is now only
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     the fallback when entry_time is unknown (state-load edge). NOT a BE-gate.
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]   + CHOP-GATE RE-ARM (CHOP_REARM_ENABLED): after a morning stand-aside, release
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     the block when a CLOSED FUT 15m bar breaks the recorded first-hour range by
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     >= CHOP_REARM_BUFFER_PT (15pt) with body >= CHOP_REARM_BODY_MIN (65%), in the
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     regime direction (BULL=>up-break only, BEAR=>down-break only, else either).
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     FUT leads spot, so this triggers earlier than a spot-range break. Re-arm is
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     one-way for the day (stays live once released); per-trade momentum/fade/CB
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     guards still apply. _morning_chop_verdict_impl() stashes FH hi/lo;
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     chop_rearm_check() evaluated each cycle while blocked. Logs [CHOPGATE] RE-ARMED.
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]   + Ladder/HARDSL/flip/VWAP-trail/stale-guard UNCHANGED. SMA8 KEPT (deleting it
2026-09-02 03:55:50,077 [INFO]     cost -66pt, V2.5.16) — this only changes WHEN it may fire, not whether.
